"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4fd8db748a1948b49031"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 999192945, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1387739247, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419175379, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Model kirim substitusi minimal {find, replace, konteks, reason}\ndocuments.edits / trackedEdits / lib/docxTrackedChanges menyusun TRACKED CHANGES\n  → versi docx baru + baris document_edits (status pending)\nEvent doc_edited → kartu EditCard (Accept / Reject) + tautan unduh\nPOST /single-documents/:id/edits/:editId/accept | reject → jejak keputusan", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Model kirim substitusi minimal {find, replace, konteks, reason}\ndocuments.edits / trackedEdits / lib/docxTrackedChanges menyusun TRACKED CHANGES\n  → versi docx baru + baris document_edits (status pending)\nEvent doc_edited → kartu EditCard (Accept / Reject) + tautan unduh\nPOST /single-documents/:id/edits/:editId/accept | reject → jejak keputusan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "38e191ec1b584034973a", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1600, "y": 420, "width": 730, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "#96f2d7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["188bc1e62f5a4d4e9705"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 474845762, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 91976826, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419175379, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "84eabca4f1594e899fe0", "type": "text", "x": 1614, "y": 464.1, "width": 164.2, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "so